    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "The solemn gatekeepers of the exam circus found their board meeting interrupted by an email that arrived like a whoopee cushion. This tip-off, from an informant in Sikar, contained leaked PDFs that matched the chemistry paper, making the whole NEET-UG 2026 examination a joke. The result was an absurd cancellation, with the testing authority scrambling as the national investigative agency now played the heavies.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Jester",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "result-0"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.85
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "The follow-up to the farce is the punchline: arrests, including a former hero now caught in the web. The coaching figure, once a public champion of student justice, is now among the unlucky thirteen. This consequence stems from the initial disclosure, a tip that exposed the farce to the law enforcement agency, leading to this consequence.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Jester",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-3",
          "result-1"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.8
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "After the grand finale that saw the whole exam become a bust, the troupe of paper-setting staff and the investigators must stage an encore performance. This planned re-examination, a rescheduled exam for June 21, is the sequel nobody asked for, a direct outcome of the initial referral and the ensuing law enforcement action.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Jester",
